OL,5,G2230 Battlefront: WWII Road to Victory
OL,6,     FAt the Battle of Stalingrad, the
OL,7,     Fbesieged Soviet Red Army turned
OL,8,     Fthe tables on the German Army.
OL,9,G2300 Prisoner: Cell Block H
OL,10,     FBea tries to comfort Lizzie. Paul
OL,11,     Fasks Bea to canvas the women for
OL,12,     Fideas on training and activities.
OL,13,     FDuring Ros's hearing, Paul
OL,14,     Frecommends maximum punishment.
OL,15,G0000 Prisoner: Cell Block H
OL,16,     FVivienne refuses to go to the
OL,17,     Frefuge and insists that Caroline
OL,18,     Fcomes home with her. In solitary,
OL,19,     FRos requests that Paul find out
OL,20,     Fwho the radio belongs to and
OL,21,     Freturn it to them.
